{"summary":"Z.O.N.A Shadow of Limansk Redux - Post-Apocalyptic Action Shooter","description":"Survive deadly combat and stealth in the poisoned wasteland of Chernobyl Zone. Play as Serioga, lead your people to safety in the old subway tunnels, and fight for survival in this immersive post-apocalyptic world.\n\n<b>Long Description:</b>\n\nZ.O.N.A Shadow of Limansk Redux is an epic, story-driven first person post-apocalyptic shooter from AGaming+. In 2014, an apocalypse destroyed most of humanity and turned the Earth's surface into a poisoned wasteland. It's now 2034, and as the surface of the Earth freezes, people must seek shelter in the old subway tunnels.\n\nYou play as Serioga, a survivor born just before the apocalypse, who must lead your people to safety and fight for survival against terrifying enemies. Explore the dangerous world, scavenge for resources, and engage in deadly combat and stealth.\n\nZ.O.N.A Shadow of Limansk Redux is one of the most immersive game worlds ever created, with stunning graphics and realistic sound effects. Can you survive and lead your people to safety? Play Z.O.N.A Shadow of Limansk Redux now and find out.","esrbNotes":"Strong Language","pegiNotes":"Strong Language","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xoc7HtGBtio?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/j7M-QXfsYHM0bhty3wrneAoCGoqEUl9pYgPETkdhFgN-JBLMzRxwGNZCwa_vIcDLWih--uVyyPVKzdzxqCIDC7g","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bAOtMHOdL0nonA155dx81e2IFfJVqCv45AVGv9tPcoEcxboZLOHhEMqZFEurH6EZ4cnjQAAS0WvoiTxPK2Rp","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jpt7oEPig4VL94j6fbyPSKA8L9RsHM3GHNp0Bh5U57mKXBSj02jCxavzoXwUNXKOK8Pu0abMaPCIzxzt04yu","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IcXGOePP_Y0MueJ6DEUL97gk0t4vINqKiwyJ2pDu8xoY6bLTDzmgQFUwRdSN1zBcESFf1FEN_HF3nnau_155KQc","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/poSdXFt5lcVWkbY22_bKSntret-hVk1T2aRvqI5R5DXoGKFMdIga567WIffqjOrf2yCPPMb243TxKdA8jXCCkQ","https://play-lh